      <title>Gorin Systems: Software UX/UI Design Lead - REMOTE</title>
      <region>Florida</region>
      <country></country>
      <state></state>
      <skills></skills>
      <category>Design</category>
      <type>Full-Time</type>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://we-work-remotely.imgix.net/logos/0171/6007/logo.gif?ixlib=rails-4.0.0&amp;w=50&amp;h=50&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=fill&amp;auto=compress" /&gt;

&lt;p&gt;
  &lt;strong&gt;Headquarters:&lt;/strong&gt; Jacksonville, Florida, 11213 United States
    &lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;URL:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="http://gorinsystems.com"&gt;http://gorinsystems.com&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="sc-1gch2qa-0 fhKCjg"&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="sc-gfrfnr-2 deOrHQ"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="sc-18h7are-0 ebVyJP"&gt;&lt;div class="sc-1tu9fip-2 ezRMeN"&gt;&lt;div class="sc-1tu9fip-1 kdUgoN"&gt;&lt;div class="sc-1tu9fip-3 iFQjUO"&gt;&lt;div class="sc-ji5wy4-0 jIYAZB"&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="sc-1uwf3m5-2 ipgOZn"&gt;&lt;div class="sc-1v95195-0 jscoSJ"&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;h2 class="sc-1npqnwg-4 sc-1npqnwg-5 sc-1uwf3m5-0 ljJezd custom-css-style-job-description"&gt;Job description&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="sc-1fwbcuw-0 dRmmCC"&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Are you excited about using technology to spread Torah and help Yidden?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Are you organized, detail-oriented, and a critical thinker?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re a software agency that works on amazing projects -&amp;nbsp;see our &lt;a href="https://gorinsystems.com"&gt;website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Talk to Clients and communicate Client Needs to development team&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Efficiently Manage and Multi-task numerous tasks and responsibilities&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Creative problem-solving&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;In-depth testing/review of web and mobile applications&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 class="sc-1npqnwg-4 sc-1npqnwg-5 sc-1uwf3m5-0 sc-1uwf3m5-1 gGOIo custom-css-style-job-requirements"&gt;Job requirements&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="sc-1fwbcuw-0 dRmmCC"&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Significant UX/UI Design Experience&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Competence in AI, Low-Code Technologies and Platforms&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Basic Hebrew Reading Comprehension&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fluent in English (verbal and written)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detail-oriented, critical thinker, quick learner&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Available to work from 9 am - 1 pm EST&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Part-time to start, with the possibility of a full-time position&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Computer Science Degree or Bootcamp, Degree in Software Design or Bootcamp&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;UX/UI Portfolio&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience managing disparate tasks and deadlines&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Professional UX/UI Design Experience&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="sc-1uwf3m5-4 fKDjfR"&gt;&lt;div class="sc-e5uvhz-0 kHqIkC"&gt;&lt;div class="sc-e5uvhz-8 ekemGm"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="sc-1f8x0pm-0 ibrjJt"&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;h3 class="sc-1npqnwg-4 sc-1npqnwg-5 sc-1f8x0pm-1 hwvvdB"&gt;All done!&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class="sc-1npqnwg-9 sc-1npqnwg-10 bCAOvV"&gt;Your application has been successfully submitted!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="sc-1f8x0pm-2 dvyFlr"&gt;&lt;a class="sc-s03za1-0 KLiTk custom-css-style-application-success-button" href="/"&gt;Other jobs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="sc-fggwcr-0 bKsRHH"&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;h3 class="sc-1npqnwg-4 sc-1npqnwg-5 sc-fggwcr-1 dJIBAL"&gt;You've already applied for this job&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class="sc-1npqnwg-9 sc-1npqnwg-10 bCAOvV"&gt;We appreciate your interest in this position. Unfortunately, you have already applied for this job.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To apply:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://weworkremotely.com/remote-jobs/gorin-systems-software-ux-ui-design-lead-remote"&gt;https://weworkremotely.com/remote-jobs/gorin-systems-software-ux-ui-design-lead-remote&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
